    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a deeper look, check out gameplay videos on YouTube \u2014 search for \u201c\u305f\u307e\u30c1\u30e3\u30f3\u30cd\u30eb Bee Hero Bug Blaster\u201d (English voiceover available)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-octane roguelite ARPG (Diablo-like) fused with node alchemy \u2014 morph your dynamic node matrix, collect epic loot, and dominate the battlefield with unstoppable power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cut to the Chase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/cca2a2d18030cb91baa47d08bce902f5.poster.avif?t=1755518353\" width=620 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/cca2a2d18030cb91baa47d08bce902f5.webm?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/cca2a2d18030cb91baa47d08bce902f5.mp4?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget bloated lore \u2014dive straight into streamlined combat and progression that rewards smart builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node Alchemy, Legendary Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/e85b7eab300154c8413c3b4c46bbfe24.poster.avif?t=1755518353\" width=620 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/e85b7eab300154c8413c3b4c46bbfe24.webm?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/e85b7eab300154c8413c3b4c46bbfe24.mp4?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast skill tree with over 1,300 nodes. Transmute entire node categories\u2014turn defense into offense or swap one skill for another. Stack node multipliers to amplify your favorite abilities and achieve exponential growth. Master complex, multi-layered synergies as you sculpt your character into a living legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hordes and Swarm Lords</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/1c18fc8aa0b5277cbfbd5e934320a775.poster.avif?t=1755518353\" width=620 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/1c18fc8aa0b5277cbfbd5e934320a775.webm?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/1c18fc8aa0b5277cbfbd5e934320a775.mp4?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through relentless insect arenas\u2014adapt your build to crush swarming hordes and towering boss monstrosities. Venture further and face ever-more formidable Swarm Lords\u2014push your build beyond its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique art style and insect\u2011themed world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1,300+\u2011node skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node transmutation and multiplication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node\u2011based meta\u2011progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally\u2011generated levels and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a deeper look, check out gameplay videos on YouTube \u2014 search for \u201c\u305f\u307e\u30c1\u30e3\u30f3\u30cd\u30eb Bee Hero Bug Blaster\u201d (English voiceover available)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-octane roguelite ARPG (Diablo-like) fused with node alchemy \u2014 morph your dynamic node matrix, collect epic loot, and dominate the battlefield with unstoppable power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cut to the Chase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/cca2a2d18030cb91baa47d08bce902f5.poster.avif?t=1755518353\" width=620 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/cca2a2d18030cb91baa47d08bce902f5.webm?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/cca2a2d18030cb91baa47d08bce902f5.mp4?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget bloated lore \u2014dive straight into streamlined combat and progression that rewards smart builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node Alchemy, Legendary Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/e85b7eab300154c8413c3b4c46bbfe24.poster.avif?t=1755518353\" width=620 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/e85b7eab300154c8413c3b4c46bbfe24.webm?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/e85b7eab300154c8413c3b4c46bbfe24.mp4?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast skill tree with over 1,300 nodes. Transmute entire node categories\u2014turn defense into offense or swap one skill for another. Stack node multipliers to amplify your favorite abilities and achieve exponential growth. Master complex, multi-layered synergies as you sculpt your character into a living legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hordes and Swarm Lords</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/1c18fc8aa0b5277cbfbd5e934320a775.poster.avif?t=1755518353\" width=620 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/1c18fc8aa0b5277cbfbd5e934320a775.webm?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/1c18fc8aa0b5277cbfbd5e934320a775.mp4?t=1755518353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through relentless insect arenas\u2014adapt your build to crush swarming hordes and towering boss monstrosities. Venture further and face ever-more formidable Swarm Lords\u2014push your build beyond its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique art style and insect\u2011themed world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1,300+\u2011node skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node transmutation and multiplication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node\u2011based meta\u2011progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally\u2011generated levels and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability</p></li></ul>",
